# SPEC §8: the image is published publicly and gitleaks scans git history,
# not image layers. Whitelist style: nothing enters the build context unless
# listed here — structurally prevents .env (and anything future) from ever
# reaching a layer. The key enters the container only via runtime environment.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
# re-exclusions inside whitelisted dirs (last match wins)
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
